  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can run up trees and other living vertical surfaces as though they were solid ground.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 15 or veilweaver level 3, ability to bind veils to your Feet slot.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the ability to bind your essence to trees, plants, and other non-sentient living things, allowing you to move up and down the surfaces of these as though you had a climb speed equal to your base land speed.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc53\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
